#X text 20 10 THE VALUES: four sounds \, one per key. Each is multiplied by its attention weight (smoothed by [line~]) and summed. chord = 220 + 330 Hz sines \, saw = 110 Hz sawtooth through a lowpass \, wind = noise in a band around 1000 Hz \, bell = FM bell at 440 Hz., f 140;
